From 4149003b1e93dd9329809d4bb6f26a5c88a7f5f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefane Fermigier <sfermigier@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 08:47:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] xmlsec: add libera-sign, which signs and checks OOXML
 packages

ooxmlsignature has a C++ interface only, which Libera Suite's Python host
cannot call: this program lists a package's signatures as the editor's
JSON, signs with a key file whose passphrase comes on standard input,
removes signatures, and prints a signer's certificate. Built beside x2t.
---
 CMakeLists.txt                                |   1 +
 .../xmlsec/libera-sign/CMakeLists.txt         |  44 +++
 DesktopEditor/xmlsec/libera-sign/main.cpp     | 261 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 306 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 DesktopEditor/xmlsec/libera-sign/CMakeLists.txt
 create mode 100644 DesktopEditor/xmlsec/libera-sign/main.cpp

